WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:03.212
♪♪

00:00:17.059 --> 00:00:19.478
A child is coming.

00:00:20.896 --> 00:00:23.357
She will thrive.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:29.613
And through her, a
family will endure.

00:00:39.164 --> 00:00:42.167
♪♪

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:49.549
♪♪

00:00:54.137 --> 00:00:57.599
I want to remember
everything, Sunja...

00:01:00.269 --> 00:01:02.229
Their faces.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:06.858
Have you ever thought about it?

00:01:08.694 --> 00:01:10.821
What your life would be like,

00:01:13.282 --> 00:01:15.534
if you chose differently?

00:01:15.993 --> 00:01:16.910
Grandmother...

00:01:17.536 --> 00:01:18.412
 What is it?

00:01:24.418 --> 00:01:27.713
If someone were to ask you
to leave your home,

00:01:27.713 --> 00:01:29.381
and begin anew,

00:01:29.381 --> 00:01:31.091
could you?

00:01:34.011 --> 00:01:34.803
People like us

00:01:34.803 --> 00:01:36.805
we don't need to
walk in our families shadows.

00:01:41.018 --> 00:01:44.563
Even if I must work
until my fingernails break,

00:01:44.563 --> 00:01:46.982
my child, he will
want for nothing.

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:51.111
♪♪

00:01:54.114 --> 00:01:57.117
♪♪

00:02:03.582 --> 00:02:04.708
Never look back,

00:02:06.668 --> 00:02:07.669
always forward.

00:02:09.671 --> 00:02:12.674
♪♪

